<font size="15" color="rgb(150, 150, 150)"><b>Helpful information</b></font>
- In the panel on the right, some buttons may only appear with certain tools. These replace keybinds, and are explained when pressing the ❔ icon.
- Is a tool's window cut? In most cases, you can scroll through said window to reach the settings you want. Always try to swipe vertically when encountering this, as it may fix this issue.

